### Get all nurseries
GET https://localhost:5001/api/nurseries

### Create a new nursery
POST https://localhost:5001/api/nurseries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Happy Kids",
  "address": "Cairo",
  "phone": "01012345678"
}

### Get by id
GET https://localhost:5001/api/nurseries/1

### Update
PUT https://localhost:5001/api/nurseries/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "Happy Kids Updated",
  "address": "Giza",
  "phone": "01087654321"
}

### Delete
DELETE https://localhost:5001/api/nurseries/1
